        "name": "Guiding Finish",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a single one-handed melee weapon and hold nothing else in your hands.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Using your weapon as a lever, you force your opponent to end up right where you want them. Make a Strike with a one-handed melee weapon. If the Strike hits, you can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Reposition] the target up to 10 feet. You can move the target through your space during this movement. Your Strike gains the following failure effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You can force the creature to move as you would on a success, but you can move the target only 5 feet.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 14
          },
          "prerequisites": {
